=== Part B: randomized CM (sigma = 1), 5 augmented copies of the same ethanol ===
  distinct row orders = 5 / 5;  ||M_rand - M_sorted||_F = 12.8, 8.0, 1.3, 8.0, 1.3   (||M_sorted||_F = 114.0)
