=== Part D: a 5-atom C1H4 geometry and a different one with the SAME eigenspectrum ===
  degrees of freedom 3N-6 = 9 > N = 5 eigenvalues
  max|lambda(R1) - lambda(R0)| = 1.4e-14
  sorted C-H distances R0: 0.821 0.934 0.963 1.117
  sorted C-H distances R1: 0.802 0.850 1.155 1.256
  sorted H-H distances R0: 1.407 1.432 1.482 1.510 1.612 1.755
  sorted H-H distances R1: 0.447 0.832 1.040 1.184 1.242 1.377
  largest difference in a sorted distance = 0.960 A  -> different molecules, same descriptor
  sorted-row CM distance between them = 3.145
=== Part E: rattled NaCl conventional cell (8 atoms, sigma = 0.1 A), shift origin by t and wrap ===
  t = ( 0.30, 0.00, 0.00) A:  cell-CM eig max|d| =   33.319   sine-matrix eig max|d| = 1.1e-13
  t = ( 1.10, 2.00,-0.70) A:  cell-CM eig max|d| =    7.442   sine-matrix eig max|d| = 2.0e-13
  t = ( 2.82, 2.82, 2.82) A:  cell-CM eig max|d| =   51.718   sine-matrix eig max|d| = 3.4e-13
  same crystal, primitive cell (2 atoms): sine eig = [450.05, 156.62]
                conventional cell (8 atoms): sine eig = [593.55, 413.29, 413.29, 413.29, 167.33, 141.98, 141.98, 141.98]
